---
title: "Session host: one channel across dcserver restarts, host loss and terminate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Recovery
    lg1: Session
    lg2: Path to the HostRecovers bug
    lg3: Repeats forever, so HostRecovers breaks
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 bugPath
  class lg3 repeats
  s0: No session
  s1: No session, a message waiting
  s2: Creating, a message waiting
  s3: dcserver down, nothing running, a message waiting
  s4: Boot reconcile, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s5: Boot reconcile, host server down, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s6: Pending, no pane recorded, host server down, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s7: No session, host server down, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s8: No session, input kept for a host, host server down (after the restart)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: a host probe stops failing or tmux becomes usable
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: a message reserves a new execution
  s2 --> s3: dcserver stops
  s3 --> s4: dcserver starts
  s4 --> s5: the host server ends
  s5 --> s6: intake opens
  s6 --> s7: the census finds nothing and closes the row
  s7 --> s8: no host: one notice, the message is kept
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 blue
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 blue
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 blue
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
  class s6 bugPath
  class s7 teal
  class s7 bugPath
  class s8 teal
  class s8 repeats
